   "evidence": "Searching for `apply Complex.ext <;> simp [log_re, log_im]` matches only Exponential.lean:164 and :243, and the `rw` chains before them are nearly identical. Mathlib has no lemma stating `log u = arg u * I` when `\u2016u\u2016 = 1`.",
